  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing Human Elephant Conflict near Ruaha National Park, Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to generate local support for the protection of elephants in and around Ruaha National Park, the grantee will assist local farmers in preventing elephant damage to crops and will also conduct outreach and park visitation programs to improve understanding of the importance of the park and to promote dialogue between park officials and local residents.</narrative>
  </description>
